# Release signing credentials — DIR-P4-02. NEVER commit these.
# Losing the keystore file (or forgetting the passwords in
# keystore.properties) means the release cert can never be reproduced:
# every future release must be signed with the SAME key as the last
# Play/sideload release, or Android refuses the upgrade and every user
# has to uninstall + reinstall (data loss). Back up keystore/ and
# keystore.properties off-disk (password manager + offline copy)
# immediately after generating them. See keystore/README.md.
keystore/*.keystore
keystore/*.jks
/keystore.properties
